[] Is it necessary to have Nethack return to the finder after each game?
[] I think that a 'would you like to play again' line would be ...

if such a feature were implemented you'd only save the time it takes to
double-click on the nethack icon to launch the game again. the restart
method seems wasteful but there is little that can be done (at present).

[] Is it also necessary to put the bones files in the system folder?

bones will be properly placed in the nethack folder in pl8. nethack
prefs will move to the system folder.

[] By the way, is there any way to change the wizardname default from h+
